    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Consequence: MemoryArtifactSource keeps TWO ephemeral checks with different keys, and both are live. The scope-keyed one (IsEphemeral(scope), used by ReadContentElementsAsync) serves the two server admin reindex loops. The name-keyed one (store.IsEphemeral(qualifiedName), inside ReadForAppendAsync) serves the three append re-embed sites. They cannot be collapsed: ParseQualifiedName has no \u0027~\u0027 branch, so it parses \u0027~note\u0027 to scope \u0022local\u0022 (subject keeps the \u0027~\u0027; SanitizeSegment does not strip it)",
