    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "How this was nearly broken (2026-08-17): a review residual brief asserted MemoryArtifactSource.EphemeralScope and IsEphemeral(string scope) were \u0027provably dead\u0027 and instructed their deletion. The claim came from checking only EmbeddingReindexer\u0027s two loops and generalising to \u0027both reindex loops\u0027. The implementer verified the other two and refused. No test drives ReindexStoreAsync against an ephemeral memory, so the deletion would have shipped green. Coverage gap still open. Before calling embed",
